            <lg xml:id="m-44501ae0-472a-4619-b4ee-c14d18ead8a1">
              <l xml:id="m-e765e41c-0a8e-4523-a7a2-45c06e92f650" facs="#m-99a11768-7938-42bd-ab0e-49e367671b0b" label="ambiguous">222</l><l xml:id="m-f7c47fd1-bea2-4ddc-ba83-673d22db7df7" facs="#m-dc3a06b8-3b16-4076-bd6f-db2d95f933e2" label="text-like">Lauds of Feasts.</l><l xml:id="m-5f554f1b-66b1-4e26-8e52-9bb1ab91baa5" facs="#m-c0bb1aeb-1aac-43a7-9959-76d2164e0fd8" label="lyrics-like">saël Dómino: “ laudáte et super¬</l><l xml:id="m-a68bbb6e-1300-45f0-aab7-703db8c709e6" facs="#m-500cffc4-ab47-4544-9d61-fcf229ab6b0c" label="text-like">cantiele of the three Children.</l><l xml:id="m-e0512d0b-4b01-4de8-b8ce-9169dd5e37f5" facs="#m-ab1f4b3f-2648-4022-bff1-398440240111" label="lyrics-like">exaltáte éum in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-2db2ab13-2db0-4ae8-a833-396c4d30e80b" facs="#m-ad6a3774-d853-46cb-b02e-cd4574825568" label="text-like">Dan. 3. 57-88 and 56.</l><l xml:id="m-97b38c0b-2426-404f-b667-4286a351286c" facs="#m-a0e76516-4004-4aa0-a37f-4e327f12d4f7" label="lyrics-like">Benedicámus Pâtrem et Filium</l><l xml:id="m-520aebfe-ebfa-4e18-8a80-0afa840d4775" facs="#m-738d681b-b954-4eca-b6df-a2dad39884e5" label="lyrics-like">QEnedicite ómnia ópera Dómint</l><l xml:id="m-30e92bac-258d-46e9-a2d2-bc78c670a23d" facs="#m-ad3c0c53-6168-47c0-ad88-76beb1ee2ab8" label="lyrics-like">cum Sáncto Spiritu:*laudémus</l><l xml:id="m-235c921b-fee1-4775-ada2-dce21a2e14bc" facs="#m-8c9b649a-6e52-4840-a9f8-a415276a93f8" label="lyrics-like">D Dómino:“laudáte et super¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f31ed2d-45eb-4f53-89fe-3df4de716a76" facs="#m-aa3674f5-5173-4f1b-ad2f-a2851be73ef6" label="lyrics-like">et superexaltémus éum in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-3dd4ad3c-d07c-4eea-bdc9-5f61405b53a8" facs="#m-1e0f3a67-cdda-4dd3-b30d-bb42a9126646" label="lyrics-like">exaltáte éum in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-7b734059-c5b0-4424-b9cd-2de761e2a2fe" facs="#m-99051b6a-1841-4ea8-b6f2-5a3ea5787926" label="lyrics-like">Benedictus es Dómine in firma¬</l><l xml:id="m-d6fde53c-2ceb-4943-b421-afa1560bb544" facs="#m-3673af57-2ff0-40fb-9964-65698cd54131" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite Angeli Dómini Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-96e641b9-f127-414b-86cb-009dee21360e" facs="#m-f9c3343c-f8c7-4157-b78d-5b153110abf7" label="lyrics-like">ménto caéli :* et laudábilis et glo¬</l><l xml:id="m-6de8db11-7bbb-4d53-b8b6-fee9e368a895" facs="#m-78cfdd6c-2571-420f-925a-8fbd5fae49e2" label="lyrics-like">no:* benedicite caéli Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-5cf90fbf-e5d0-4c9e-9ebf-9233a3926e32" facs="#m-7cc9e057-bc7b-401d-9ab5-22ed827c7d1d" label="lyrics-like">riósus et superexaltátus in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-073f4b9b-2e03-4cf4-83b8-715b2b860ccd" facs="#m-d027d642-d8bf-4d82-a0a2-0d646e1bef06" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite áquae ómnes quae su¬</l><l xml:id="m-d991f269-f820-470c-9eb0-79afec82b3f2" facs="#m-ae8b82ab-de41-4bba-a293-a2e54faf9cbe" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri. Is not said, nor is</l><l xml:id="m-8077c905-0800-4337-ae3a-6a6be088516c" facs="#m-3035ee59-ceca-4559-81d3-a2ebc0b23d83" label="lyrics-like">percaélos sunt Dómino:* benedicite</l><l xml:id="m-dc606f6e-ff0b-4d60-8bdd-06cfbc39c049" facs="#m-08e7e5da-ecaa-4ecc-9158-492d097a50a5" label="text-like">Amen. out the fourth Antiphon is</l><l xml:id="m-4e32ce66-a634-4e6c-99c8-7de82e8b19e7" facs="#m-a373bcbb-d569-4eb5-947c-45e1e2828038" label="lyrics-like">ómnes virtútes Dómini Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-55c45e92-7d6d-47da-910a-0ec7a315af53" facs="#m-2a4e8a35-7428-41d5-ac0a-aa3e15de4f3a" label="ambiguous">repeated.</l><l xml:id="m-d8472fdb-12aa-4f3f-9dea-c10c6bdfe181" facs="#m-248ce8a3-9ee3-42db-a307-463b1b3c2e8f" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite sol et lúna Dómino:</l><l xml:id="m-8fb5d2b5-eed0-4492-baf6-4509d4a851a5" facs="#m-8a9e82c9-4c78-4bc9-aa58-4e86bab28468" label="text-like">Fifth Antiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-74e7a461-2721-4392-888e-22e2ff406001" facs="#m-adb609f3-2727-47e9-8b2a-fb8c13bd30dd" label="lyrics-like">benedícite stéllae caéli Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-43c99362-d09e-44b4-92c4-94ea3017a465" facs="#m-67ca3e0d-d149-4bc3-b935-372a2cbf9e60" label="ambiguous">Psalm 148.</l><l xml:id="m-8d18f94f-4d39-4668-b5ad-620ab78fa440" facs="#m-f29476bb-c4c7-4a20-9392-1073f1cb7fbb" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite ómnis imber et ros</l><l xml:id="m-3491949f-3248-462c-9ed5-42700c6f647b" facs="#m-4e9f77a8-84d2-4c84-a665-71a8f9e88d64" label="lyrics-like">Audáte Dóminum de caélis:</l><l xml:id="m-1b65b1b4-5128-45f3-b7c2-f42a2c8ea6c0" facs="#m-7f7b31c1-247b-48bb-856f-3d6b23d961be" label="lyrics-like">Dómino :* benedicite ómnes spíri¬</l><l xml:id="m-256f4eeb-01b1-45a0-a482-6e60704005a5" facs="#m-86d9918a-c8f9-4be1-b7c7-e240d6533749" label="lyrics-like">Il laudáte éum in excélsis.</l><l xml:id="m-304760ba-f563-4982-9974-ee14721088cb" facs="#m-181b8dde-becb-4e27-91bb-a9a9ddcff382" label="lyrics-like">tus Dei Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-356514fb-49ea-43ae-8146-4421aface7e1" facs="#m-8ad5859a-31eb-460e-9d53-d1cec53925be" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite ignis et aéstus Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e8995634-d5ed-4926-b21e-12d36e7e73b1" facs="#m-0697296e-1907-4a28-9e08-72db7458a88d" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte éumómnes Angeliéjus:"</l><l xml:id="m-ec130362-1c12-45ab-ae82-6ba6fc13f3ce" facs="#m-3de459d3-8f5f-4d9a-86eb-e59fe1fcdb03" label="lyrics-like">*benedicite frigus et aéstus</l><l xml:id="m-410bf4fc-001f-4f00-940f-7bd32b1eadca" facs="#m-d4bc286c-8cd0-440e-8ba6-913d1ddd3ce3" label="lyrics-like">laudáte éum ômnes Virtütes éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-909dc6b7-433b-47cf-9447-8eef44b50be5" facs="#m-0760e76f-5a54-462e-8909-37afef3a90a0" label="lyrics-like">Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-2f4a97b4-2c18-43b0-bdd3-086ef08ba3b0" facs="#m-00888a2f-5d9c-46dc-ba3a-778bc278bd0f" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte éum sól et lúna : * lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f8aad4a-92d0-4c5f-8ee6-965aa7aef167" facs="#m-d7499f83-33ae-4174-bc69-d093ccfa7286" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite róres et pruina Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b38ba661-defc-46bf-b775-0582096597b3" facs="#m-4c2d1d65-c0d8-46d5-9681-e3ce03b037f6" label="lyrics-like">dáte éum ómnes stéllae et lúmen.</l><l xml:id="m-131e9424-6733-4d91-8c44-987665f8ccdc" facs="#m-a46a09d1-8651-4d0b-97a1-04ec245a3dfd" label="lyrics-like">no:* benedicite gélu et frigus Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c766112-305b-499e-a63c-4e70a81f3f40" facs="#m-d1ea7313-d6c7-4964-ae10-ef466343daf8" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte éum caéli caelórum:</l><l xml:id="m-0859359e-7521-4a9f-bc13-bb558ff53737" facs="#m-c025a276-dcbc-435b-8230-7aeb91564e43" label="ambiguous">mino.</l><l xml:id="m-813a348b-5682-49f2-b237-d31792176acd" facs="#m-000f5ae4-bf50-4e90-80a2-b287ad5e1957" label="lyrics-like">et áquae ómnes quae super caélos</l><l xml:id="m-5aeab328-5eb1-41ba-9b8f-fc618a4952d7" facs="#m-41105a4d-b0bd-4c96-9a61-9efaf29da02d" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite glácies et nives Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6559fe31-0f1a-428f-9516-44cdde38f84a" facs="#m-585fac48-ad76-47fa-a73f-9dc763a89891" label="lyrics-like">sunt, láudent nómen Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-91ab40e6-9429-4d6a-8dea-e7f1a119e31c" facs="#m-62782689-37f7-4d65-b63a-f756b3b8d7c8" label="lyrics-like">Quia ipse dixit, et fácta sunt:</l><l xml:id="m-7de82be8-54d1-413c-9c12-2154f6a12aee" facs="#m-022f69da-8c92-42e7-8fb4-72d1ad85b92f" label="lyrics-like">mino:* benedícite nóctes et dies</l><l xml:id="m-6c3c06b3-bf34-4466-89cc-258f84957127" facs="#m-357d9f02-506d-4708-9394-dfeb4514dd11" label="lyrics-like">Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-aee7eb22-268b-4db9-8dc4-51834292a706" facs="#m-ac8c62d8-a6db-40fc-b88a-1a5d5648988d" label="lyrics-like">Ipsẽ mandávit, et creâta sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-cf950d51-a6f0-4a2d-86aa-ece9c6259828" facs="#m-c2e4b999-d0e0-4d2b-b470-523d25ff199e" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite lux et ténebrae Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5edfa091-fb60-45d5-a8d7-b086223beeee" facs="#m-2f215092-79a4-4bc1-a593-4c819ae468b6" label="lyrics-like">Státuit éa in aetérnum et in saé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4b013d4-a697-4567-bbf3-923ab24a04b3" facs="#m-13076105-d93d-46cf-af20-d3cca556e276" label="lyrics-like">no:* benedicite fúlgura et núbes</l><l xml:id="m-2c5aa834-b508-432a-8138-2936b0964efa" facs="#m-f501f901-b6c0-484a-ba1b-76b4f4b0ade3" label="lyrics-like">culum saéculi:* praecéptum pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d16fe62e-b13c-465a-b2c6-04a7d9834aee" facs="#m-cbb8741c-be33-44c8-af6e-d1029461e462" label="lyrics-like">Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-7330a669-3208-492c-aead-7d701df08908" facs="#m-6627b236-10a0-4a82-b380-22f96542052c" label="ambiguous">suit, et non praeteribit.</l><l xml:id="m-803e384e-49a5-4c48-81a6-30a2a3b11185" facs="#m-cd5dbccf-df09-4106-8799-2f0859797cf2" label="lyrics-like">Benedicat térra Dóminum :* láu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5da2b746-8636-4a0a-842f-a1ce89faa84f" facs="#m-ed69a5eb-53e1-4909-8dbb-03311d41450d" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte Dóminum de térra.</l><l xml:id="m-0635b5e9-31a7-4141-b2fe-1fbab66ca2ac" facs="#m-33ce572d-9f99-429c-a9d0-d6aa47fcfd99" label="lyrics-like">det et superexáltet éum in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-f69d3aad-85cb-46c8-90cd-eae554243264" facs="#m-3381e707-cdb2-4e7b-9dfc-88ff8d0040ff" label="lyrics-like">dracónes et ómnes abyssi:</l><l xml:id="m-c0ab3475-f976-4aeb-a25f-bcf9f2ec8b59" facs="#m-0d9f076f-1810-4e8b-a9d1-d5666c028002" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite móntes et cólles Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-80435a02-a892-447a-8dc5-0b39656dfaf0" facs="#m-d280d008-54f0-4f04-ae0d-519d8070154b" label="lyrics-like">Ignis, grándo, nix, glácies, spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-5dbd79a9-8940-4543-ae97-4b0661d0927d" facs="#m-e59691a6-6314-4d4d-b336-c331be8e7424" label="lyrics-like">mino :* benedicite univérsa germi¬</l><l xml:id="m-393dbbe1-8ae9-493c-bb77-9e604cfa791f" facs="#m-7f9091e3-8803-4bf4-837b-cb59e75081e0" label="lyrics-like">tus procellárum, * quae fáciunt</l><l xml:id="m-7a59cef5-c213-4caa-a7ca-9e98e1fdca53" facs="#m-4fc821d1-9e8a-4c95-ae30-335ba2614280" label="lyrics-like">nántia in térra Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-26e4488b-c73e-4c90-bee6-d751115769df" facs="#m-2e22962f-7908-4678-a1d6-67062c42cd0f" label="lyrics-like">vérbum éius</l><l xml:id="m-11ba6f09-cb69-4a1e-9863-cae797b0110c" facs="#m-3926b6fc-8507-43c2-87cc-260c7aa32b3f" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite fóntes Domino :* be¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d555935-ad16-484e-bdeb-1bde52ef040e" facs="#m-30114573-a1ad-47a0-b79d-1cbf62b18ebf" label="lyrics-like">Móntes et ómnes colles,“ligna</l><l xml:id="m-c0211a56-674b-4402-8bde-59e928b2f725" facs="#m-f3bde642-318e-4ee9-a14f-580e18c717eb" label="lyrics-like">nedicite mária et flúmina Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-86f30f26-faf9-43df-94fa-8b7cac338b04" facs="#m-8b36a388-c42a-48c7-80bb-9d275f260853" label="lyrics-like">fructífera et ómnes cédri :</l><l xml:id="m-8cd4ad52-1aba-42f9-ad1c-ef0e9af117f1" facs="#m-db73609e-52f0-4e53-a239-6bc6b9367a6c" label="lyrics-like">Béstiae et univérsa pécora,</l><l xml:id="m-b2e9e2b6-1235-47b8-9444-94ca0b8d3412" facs="#m-db8b5f91-f903-4fe7-a0f3-adc3e3ee1b48" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite céte et ómnia quae mo¬</l><l xml:id="m-b226bdce-52bb-4ef7-a6f4-4ba9d90d7b40" facs="#m-528f7c0d-4141-4ab6-8bb9-bdcc2f265b77" label="lyrics-like">véntur in áquis Dómino : * benedí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8149f4a7-5542-4367-b1c6-39d23f0571b5" facs="#m-690fcaa7-6bdf-422f-bf47-972bc4568e22" label="lyrics-like">serpéntes et vólueres pennátae:</l><l xml:id="m-c2c1d408-4d87-4b0e-8fb3-f4d99dbefc70" facs="#m-c0ca793e-1868-417a-a366-c5a65c938258" label="lyrics-like">cite ómnes vólucres caéli Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-53822905-b80d-41f8-8fd4-7d131866c395" facs="#m-218e67c9-7000-42e4-8daf-8553b0c9fb45" label="lyrics-like">Réges térrae et ómnes pópuli.»</l><l xml:id="m-e16d7e4b-762e-44a0-90cc-46859000084d" facs="#m-31a80546-5730-453f-b716-85956163eb08" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite ómnes béstiae et pé¬</l><l xml:id="m-8675ef4a-eedf-48ff-be11-a1e8f23d19d6" facs="#m-a27f1f8b-b365-4d76-9260-4006e81bba3d" label="lyrics-like">principes et ómnes júdices térrac.</l><l xml:id="m-4fe07fae-8df3-4f20-bf90-4474e7629963" facs="#m-cfbd6c20-2d10-42e0-b82e-c299be68151a" label="lyrics-like">cora Dómino :* benedicite filii hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-80c8a247-7d88-4d3c-95c5-ce38e2025857" facs="#m-13401cac-9d04-40cb-a75d-3eb15a59857f" label="lyrics-like">Júvenes et vírgines, t sénes cum</l><l xml:id="m-8bb789f7-6dde-4683-93e3-729a934b6260" facs="#m-19dcf8b9-106d-441e-bc5b-aa94b63befcd" label="lyrics-like">minum Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-2ebad9e9-a895-482b-af03-2f74b7093a2c" facs="#m-2e99d824-c3de-4e7f-89f3-0882c2dbb9b2" label="lyrics-like">junióribus láudent nómen Dómini:"</l><l xml:id="m-d26100b8-972e-4cf4-b7fb-4a9b809e0db1" facs="#m-5b31c0d9-7f04-410e-9aa7-fc4f52a78572" label="lyrics-like">BenedicatIsrael Dóminum :* láu¬</l><l xml:id="m-15096e72-6519-4607-94ab-67f6a85e544b" facs="#m-31442b8c-20eb-4e4a-bcda-98e3496846ee" label="lyrics-like">quia exaltátum est nómen éjus so¬</l><l xml:id="m-410fea41-e808-462d-9320-c55f3daed050" facs="#m-f5599678-4528-4906-ad9d-2751da5bd83a" label="lyrics-like">det et superexáltet éum in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-99c2c637-16b4-4172-be08-aee22005c0ba" facs="#m-b9de243d-5192-471d-a804-a89e37a6aa8d" label="ambiguous">fius.</l><l xml:id="m-9d716de1-b87f-45d3-9ad7-209d7517c80d" facs="#m-979ee1c8-0e7a-4e9f-8f1a-d450fc79e337" label="lyrics-like">Conféssio éjus super caélum et</l><l xml:id="m-16105d3f-146c-43e6-9643-33cffbe249a8" facs="#m-42be4c21-1033-4133-a94e-75ce3c4c4645" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite sacerdótes Dómini Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-263309fd-0f87-4a3f-b3e4-186b4f3f437e" facs="#m-207e0754-fab8-4fff-a327-5cad18767683" label="lyrics-like">térram : * et exaltávit córnu pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-4151ab8a-1295-4ea4-9bcc-381b1fb7e314" facs="#m-9228dc13-1755-4d36-af99-374274863242" label="lyrics-like">mino : * benedicite sérvi Dómini</l><l xml:id="m-d8376c2a-419e-4b19-b41a-3b66ffa76644" facs="#m-27ddbfbe-a6b3-42a2-8387-ee1c9d7a91c7" label="lyrics-like">Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-ee373cd9-199b-4b26-a188-8677200d7add" facs="#m-86611841-8eab-4095-8bd2-c29aa281f409" label="ambiguous">puli sui.</l><l xml:id="m-04931ca9-46ad-4634-b38f-6b6b07c30f94" facs="#m-8990f1cf-0d37-4a62-9856-2722d44b2e1c" label="lyrics-like">Benedicite spíritus et ánimae ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-c00e0092-ebce-4f0a-88d0-5f7450a7ce7c" facs="#m-bdda2eff-af43-4713-9cb1-d4b19e441146" label="lyrics-like">Hymnus ómnibus sánctis éjus:</l><l xml:id="m-1f5b7732-06b9-487f-82e6-4d46f42afa76" facs="#m-ee0820eb-7755-4c30-983f-aa6f7cd33086" label="lyrics-like">stórum Dómino:* benedicite sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fa5da0d-d276-480c-aa32-8dde15a54a3c" facs="#m-d1227eb3-1443-4a32-9d2d-6d848ff99a1b" label="lyrics-like">filis Israel, pópulo appropinquanti</l><l xml:id="m-0553dc21-1b43-41d1-abe8-9efdb6779697" facs="#m-3e0adea2-3704-4cf6-a2bf-e6481ccdb7ca" label="lyrics-like">cti et húmiles córde Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-46f40a00-9439-4f75-b56b-90e71815d52b" facs="#m-184f297b-2fbe-4200-9522-0f602b3c7fea" label="ambiguous">sibi.</l><l xml:id="m-dbd3e58d-9b6b-4240-a301-abfc72866c4b" facs="#m-c085af00-a3b8-480e-97cc-c4f7ab04ea0d" label="text-like">The fifth Antiphon is repeated.</l><l xml:id="m-8c0830b1-1baa-4f4f-ae12-e1de5fc557d3" facs="#m-1284b48d-a27f-4095-8520-8dd0e77926f9" label="ambiguous">Benedicite Anania, Azaria, Mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f99de4f7-3eba-4629-83e8-d374d1abac5a" facs="#m-6e989d2d-d7c0-4c77-8639-145031a8a0b5" label="text-like">After the Psalms, the Chapter is said; then the Hymn, the Versicte, and</l><l xml:id="m-869521d1-bb32-4600-9ae1-1b3222320b5f" facs="#m-d44c34dc-b329-45a1-bf56-c4f4cefa449f" label="text-like">me Antiphon of the Canticle Benedictus. all of umich' are found at the</l><l xml:id="m-60caf110-0d15-4308-8f83-319caa7cea04" facs="#m-5b0f2ce6-70bd-494a-bf59-820a0e54cff3" label="text-like">Proper of the Feast.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
